## Phase 1 구현 완료 체크리스트

```
[ ] backend/core/config/settings.py    — Pydantic BaseSettings
[ ] backend/core/database.py           — AsyncSession 팩토리
[ ] domain/multiagent/models/bases/    — Persona, AdAnalysis, PersonaResponse
[ ] domain/multiagent/models/enums/    — SimulationStatus, ScrollBehavior 등
[ ] domain/multiagent/models/states/   — SimulationState TypedDict
[ ] domain/multiagent/models/transfer/ — 요청/응답 DTO
[ ] spokes/agents/ad_understanding.py  — GPT-4o Vision 이미지 분석
[ ] spokes/agents/persona_generation.py — 페르소나 20명 생성
[ ] spokes/agents/reaction_simulation.py — 소비자 반응 시뮬레이션 (핵심)
[ ] spokes/agents/prediction.py        — 5개 성과 지표 산출
[ ] spokes/agents/validation.py        — IQR 이상치 제거
[ ] spokes/agents/recommendation.py   — 개선안 생성
[ ] hub/repositories/                  — DB CRUD
[ ] hub/services/simulation_service.py — 비즈니스 로직
[ ] hub/orchestrator/simulation_graph.py — LangGraph 조립
[ ] api/v1/multiagent/router.py        — REST 엔드포인트
[ ] main.py                            — FastAPI 앱, CORS, 헬스체크
[ ] alembic/                           — DB 마이그레이션 초기화
```

